---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = "+17044696658";
const phoneDisplay = "+1 (704) 469-6658";
---
<Layout title="Compressor Repair Gastonia NC | AC Compressor Diagnosis | acrepairgastonianc.com" description="AC compressor repair in Gastonia, NC. Accurate diagnosis of repair vs. replacement. Honest guidance, no upsell. Call +1 (704) 469-6658.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Services / Compressor Repair</p>
      <h1>Compressor Repair in Gastonia, NC</h1>
      <p>The compressor is the heart of your AC. We diagnose accurately — repair or replace — and explain your options clearly.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>The compressor is the heart of your AC system. <strong>Compressor Repair</strong> requires precision — our technicians accurately diagnose whether repair or replacement is the right call, saving you from unnecessary costs.</p>
      <p>Symptoms of compressor trouble include: system running but not cooling, hard starts, unusual humming or grinding from the outdoor unit, tripping breakers, and high amp draw. In Gastonia heat, a struggling compressor degrades quickly if left unaddressed.</p>
      <h2>Repair vs. Replace — Honest Assessment</h2>
      <p>We apply industry benchmarks (system age, repair cost relative to unit value, refrigerant type, history of failures) so you get a clear recommendation — not a push toward the more expensive option. A compressor failure on a 15+ year-old R-22 system often justifies a replacement conversation; on a younger R-410A system, repair can still make sense.</p>
      <div class="cta-box">
        <p>Suspect compressor issues? Get an honest diagnosis.</p>
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
